 How the Recovery Process Works
1. Wallet Transaction Analysis
Our team analyzes blockchain transactions connected to the scam using digital forensic tools. This helps trace the movement of funds from the victim’s wallet to receiving wallets or exchanges.
2. Blockchain Intelligence &#038; Asset Tracing
Using open-source intelligence (OSINT), blockchain analytics, and investigative methods, we map transaction paths and identify patterns connected to suspicious wallets or accounts.
3. Scammer Identification
Identifying the individual, group, or entity behind the wallet activity is a key step. Once potential identities or linked platforms are discovered, victims can better understand where their funds may have been sent.
4. Recovery Guidance &#038; Case Support
After analysis is completed, we guide victims on appropriate next steps. This may include reporting to exchanges, working with financial institutions, or seeking legal and law enforcement assistance where applicable.
 About Our Investigation Team
Intelligence Cyber Wizard works with a network of experienced investigators and cybersecurity professionals who specialize in digital crime analysis.
