* Experience in cyber investigations, intelligence gathering, and digital asset tracing
* A registered business entity in the United States (Michigan LLC)
Our mission is to provide victims with accurate information, investigative insights, and professional guidance during difficult situations.
 Important Warning for Scam Victims
If you have been scammed, be cautious of services that promise unrealistic results. There is no guaranteed or instant way to recover stolen cryptocurrency.
Be wary of anyone claiming:
* “99% guaranteed crypto recovery”
* Recovery within a few hours
* Instant or forced retrieval of funds
* Unrealistic success claims
